{
  "about": "What a builtin costs in count mode, beyond the lines it is called from. n is the length of the container the operation works on, i the index it works at, k the length of what it takes or makes. Read by runner.py and, from slice 3, by the JavaScript instrumenter. Anything not listed is free: dict and set lookups, deque.popleft, appends.",
